.TH TULPAR.CONF 5 "2026" "tulpar 0.1.0" "Tulpar Manual"
.SH NAME
tulpar.conf \- tulpar configuration file
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tulpar.conf
holds global settings for
.BR tulpar (1).
It is a plain text file, one
.I key
=
.I value
assignment per line. Lines starting with
.B #
are comments; blank lines are ignored. There are no sections.
.PP
Two files are read, in order, and later values override earlier ones:
.IP 1. 4
.I /etc/apg/tulpar.conf
(system-wide)
.IP 2. 4
.I ~/.config/apg/tulpar.conf
(per-user override)
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B cache_dir
Root of the local package and repodata cache. Default
.IR /var/cache/apg .
.TP
.B db_dir
Default package database directory used when
.B \-\-dest
is not given. Default
.IR /var/lib/apg/db .
.TP
.B log_file
Path to the log file. Default
.IR /var/log/tulpar.log .
.TP
.B repodata_ttl
Cache lifetime for
.B repodata.json
in seconds. Default
.IR 900 " (15 minutes)."
.TP
.B max_parallel_downloads
Maximum number of concurrent downloads within a single transaction.
Default
.IR 4 .
.TP
.B require_signature
.IR true " or " false .
When true, packages whose signature cannot be verified are rejected
instead of only producing a warning. Default
.IR false .
.TP
.B sign_backend
.IR sodium " or " gpgme .
Selects which of libapg's two signing backends is used to verify
package signatures. Default
.IR sodium .
.TP
.B color_theme
Accent color used for informational output:
.IR cyan ", " blue ", " magenta ", " green ", " yellow ", or " red .
Default
.IR cyan .
Has no effect when color is disabled; see
.B NO_COLOR
in
.BR tulpar (1).
.TP
.B verbose
.IR true " or " false .
Enable debug-level log and output verbosity. Default
.IR false .
.TP
.B quiet
.IR true " or " false .
Suppress informational output. Default
.IR false .
.TP
.B journald
.IR true " or " false .
On Linux, additionally mirror log lines to syslog/journald. Ignored
on non-Linux platforms. Default
.IR false .
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
# system-wide tulpar configuration
cache_dir = /var/cache/apg
repodata_ttl = 900
max_parallel_downloads = 4
require_signature = false
sign_backend = sodium
color_theme = cyan
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tulpar (1)
